    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Between Port-Fréjus and the Base Nature, Le Cabanon has a vintage French Riviera feel with a lovely sea view. Casual, family-friendly beach dining, perfect for a no-fuss meal after a morning spent exploring with your dog.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>This spot is especially handy if you're spending the day at the Woof & Wow dog park (Woof Park), just nearby: you can go straight from playtime to lunch without getting back in the car.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: combine your visit with the Woof & Wow dog park (Woof Park), just steps away, for a full day of play and a meal almost on the sand.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>The Woof & Wow dog park (Woof Park) is very close, a large enclosed space ideal for letting your dog burn off energy before or after the meal.</p>
